From cd0876b55e13bbaf39758bff8973e190dd96e706 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: letress <212964567+letress@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:04:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 111/113] drm: Add the Exynos9610 display controller driver
 (takes over the bootloader state)

DECON0 window 0 with its read DMA: flips frame buffers, reports vblank and
switches the backlight with the CRTC. Timing, clocks, power, DSIM and the panel
stay as the bootloader left them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
